	<p>&nbsp;</p>
	<p class="lead">Lenovo Press 网站信息请通过联想账号访问</p>
	<p class="lead">Lenovo Press is only accessible with a Lenovo account. Please login to continue.</p>
	<p><a href="/lenovousers/authcheck?redirect=/lp1814.pdf" class="btn btn-primary">Lenovo Account Login</a></p>
	<p>您也可以联系客户 & 合作伙伴服务热线 400-819-6776 或者 <script type="text/javascript" language="javascript">
{document.write(String.fromCharCode(60,97,32,104,114,101,102,61,34,109,97,105,108,116,111,58,107,97,98,111,110,108,105,110,101,111,112,115,64,108,101,110,111,118,111,46,99,111,109,34,32,62,107,97,98,111,110,108,105,110,101,111,112,115,64,108,101,110,111,118,111,46,99,111,109,60,47,97,62))}
</script>
